OL,3,GNEWSAHomes and businesses evacuated
OL,4,Aafter gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 20 homes and a number of local
OL,7,Fbusinesses have been evacuated
OL,8,Ffollowing a gas leak in Omagh.
OL,10,FThe Gortin Road has been closed at its
OL,11,Fjunction with the Killybrack Road.
OL,13,FThe council have told local
OL,14,Frepresentatives a digger hit a mains
OL,15,Fgas pipe at the junction of Gortin Road
OL,16,Fand Strathroy Road.
OL,18,FA 100-metre evacuation zone is in place
OL,19,Fthere is a large police and fire
OL,20,Fservice presence in the area.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
